OL,3,ALightning strike disrupts flights at
OL,4,ALuton Airport
OL,5,
OL,6,FA lightning strike on air traffic
OL,7,Fcontrol systems at Luton Airport has
OL,8,Faffected flight landings and schedules.
OL,10,FA spokesperson for the airport said
OL,11,Foperations were suspended between 17:40
OL,12,Fand 19:15 BST, "resulting in a number
OL,13,Fof cancellations and diversions" to
OL,14,Fflights.
OL,16,FThe disruption had coincided with a
OL,17,F"period of severe weather" in the area
OL,18,Fthat had resulted in flash flooding,
OL,19,Fthey added.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,0,100
