OL,3,ALightning strike disrupts flights at
OL,4,ALuton Airport
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe spokesperson apologised for any
OL,7,Fdisruption caused and advised
OL,8,Fpassengers to check the status of their
OL,9,Fflight with their airline.
